# Gap-review gate courier scratch (transient — the extracted per-angle prompt payloads
# the SDK gate ships to reviewers; reproducible from REVIEW_PROMPTS + the build docs.
# The real rigor trail is the GAP_REVIEW_*.md findings, which ARE tracked.)
**/.sent/

# Supabase CLI auto-update cache (transient — version string only)
supabase/.temp/

